    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need someone to talk to? Lisa is here to support you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy visual novel, you can share your worries with Lisa, choose what\u2019s on your mind, and receive her warm, uplifting advice. She won\u2019t judge, she won\u2019t turn away \u2013 she\u2019ll simply help you see things from a different perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Interactive experience:</strong> choose your concern and get a personal response from Lisa.<br>\u2714 <strong>Comforting atmosphere:</strong> soft colors, soothing music, and kind words create a relaxing space.<br>\u2714 <strong>Stress-free format:</strong> no complex mechanics, just a heartfelt conversation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lisa is here. Just tell her what\u2019s on your mind.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need someone to talk to? Lisa is here to support you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy visual novel, you can share your worries with Lisa, choose what\u2019s on your mind, and receive her warm, uplifting advice. She won\u2019t judge, she won\u2019t turn away \u2013 she\u2019ll simply help you see things from a different perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Interactive experience:</strong> choose your concern and get a personal response from Lisa.<br>\u2714 <strong>Comforting atmosphere:</strong> soft colors, soothing music, and kind words create a relaxing space.<br>\u2714 <strong>Stress-free format:</strong> no complex mechanics, just a heartfelt conversation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lisa is here. Just tell her what\u2019s on your mind.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Lisa is here to listen. Choose what\u2019s on your mind, and she\u2019ll help you see things differently. This visual novel is a cozy space where you can relax, get support, and hear kind words. Sometimes, all you need is someone who truly understands.",
